    "detailed_description": "In this third person game you will control Larry, a man in a wheelchair who moves slowly but can be quite lethal. <br />\r\nThe game consist of 7 different levels in which you'll have to progress by fighting enemies, surviving hordes of enemies, bosses and solving kinder garden level puzzles.<br />\r\nYou'll start the game with 3 basic moves (The ability to explode and not harm yourself, a spin that hurts your enemies and the ability to fart and stun enemies).<br />\r\nThrough the levels you'll be unlocking new moves. This moves make the game easier for you but require higher skills to be applied correctly. <br />\r\nThe game is not made with the intention of offending anyone. If you decide to play it I hope you have fun.",
